 5 grids runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 166% of normal in January to February but only 59% in July to August and 56% in November to December. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 47% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 20274 had its driest year in 1963 at 66% of normal.</p>"}
